\n\n*   **事实支撑**：Kubernetes 事件日志 `fact-00b03486d720` 和 `fact-344c1fdfbd1b` 明确记录了 `NoNetworkFound` 及 `cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network)` 错误。\n*   **结论逻辑**：Pod 配置中的网络注解指向了不存在的自定义网络资源，导致负责网络配置的 Multus 插件无法完成沙箱的网络设置，进而被 kubelet 中止并反复重试，表现为 Pod 长期处于 `ContainerCreating` 状态。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 6.4m\n├─ 问题定位: 21.9s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 348.5s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh: 348.5s (Evidence 341.2s, RCA 7.2s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 11.2s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh**: pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 381.658, "metrics": {"run_id": "62b67368efcf44e4", "mttr": {"value": "6.4m", "seconds": 381.6618347167969, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.9, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-volume-mount-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description"